# Dark Samus fn_10_F84C: real player beam shots (`shoot`, a CEnergyProjectile from the player's gun
# through CEnergyProjectile::ResolveCollisionWithActor) landing on the boss in both shield states.
# Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2 (MP2_WORLD="1baa96c2,10_cliff_rooftop" MP2_INPUT="LAYER2@400"),
# boss u04f7; spec tools/cov/specs/darksamus_ds10_f84c.py. Activate starts the BoostBallRoll, whose
# ball's 2.3-unit collision sphere encloses the boss and takes every shot, so DiveFromBoost deletes
# the ball (fn_10_9AC4) first. Pause leaves the shield byte 0xCD0 at 0 (response 0x2E, the shots
# damage), SuperMissileAttack and FreezeBeam set it through fn_10_105F4 (response 0x6A, no damage).
@f1200 send u04f7 Activate
@f1300 place u04f7 player 8
@f1305 fsm u04f7 DiveFromBoost
@f1330 objs CDarkSamusBoostBall
@f1340 place u04f7 player 8; fsm u04f7 Pause
@f1346 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 0 0 -1
@f1352 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 1 0 0
@f1358 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir -1 0 0
@f1364 obj u04f7
@f1374 place u04f7 player 8; fsm u04f7 SuperMissileAttack
@f1380 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 0 0 -1
@f1386 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 1 0 0
@f1392 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir -1 0 0
@f1398 obj u04f7
@f1408 place u04f7 player 8; fsm u04f7 FreezeBeam
@f1414 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 0 0 -1
@f1420 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 1 0 0
@f1426 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir -1 0 0
@f1432 obj u04f7
@f1442 place u04f7 player 8; fsm u04f7 Pause
@f1448 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 0 0 -1
@f1454 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir 1 0 0
@f1460 shoot u04f7 1.5 dir -1 0 0
@f1466 obj u04f7
@f1476 status
